Topic 08 – Arrays
Objective: Array declaration, traversal, manipulation, searching, sorting and multidimensional arrays.
No.	Program	Requirement
01	Array Traversal	Declare an integer array and print all elements using a for loop.
02	Sum and Average	Calculate the sum and average of all array elements.
03	Largest and Smallest	Find the largest and smallest elements in an array.
04	Reverse an Array	Reverse the array without using another array.
05	Linear Search	Search for a given element and print its index if found.
06	Sort an Array	Sort an integer array in ascending order without using built-in sorting methods.
07	Duplicate Elements	Identify and print duplicate elements in an array.
08	Remove Duplicates	Create a new array containing only unique elements.
09	Second Largest Number	Find the second-largest distinct number in an array.
10	Matrix Addition	Add two 2D matrices and print the resulting matrix.